{"canonical_line_id": "cl_6ff052659c4a", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00003", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-3"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-3"], "text": "本日は2026年7月期第3四半期決戦についてご案内申し上げます。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783926518.0391338, "updated_at": 1783926518.0391338, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_b0dcf931be7b", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00004", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-4"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-4"], "text": "まずは二千二十六年七月期第三四半期決算概要についてお知らせいたします。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783926518.0391617, "updated_at": 1783926518.039162, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_8cb61fc41459", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00005", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-5", "stable-6"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-5", "stable-6"], "text": "売上高については百三十六億七千九百万となり前年同期比五点四パーセントの減収となりました。は既存園の在籍率向上や工程価格の上昇による補助金増額保育所の新規開設や増床が寄与し主力の保育サービスにおいて増収となりました", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783926518.03919, "updated_at": 1783926518.03919, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_b336a74e7627", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00006", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-7"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-7"], "text": "不動産事業は前期に計上した大型不動産売却案件の反動により当期も不動産売却は実施したものの、全体としては減少となりした。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783926518.0392175, "updated_at": 1783926518.0392175, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_35569f4bc32a", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00007", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-8", "stable-9", "stable-10"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-8", "stable-9", "stable-10"], "text": "なお、その他サービスは概ね計画どり進捗しております。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783926518.0392437, "updated_at": 1783926518.0392437, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_47490e5ec100", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00008", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-11"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-11"], "text": "営業利益は十億六千百万円となり前年同期比一点五パーセントの原因となりました不採算事業の撤退や中核事業の合理が業務効率化により営業利益率は七点五パーセントから七点に向上しました経常利益は十一億二千八百万円となり、前年同期比九点五パーセントの増益となりました。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783926518.03927, "updated_at": 1783926518.03927, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_1ed03c2a41e3", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00009", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-12", "stable-13"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-12", "stable-13"], "text": "保育所の新規開設や蔵書の実施によりこれらに伴う開演前の補助金収入が加算されたことにより増益となります。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783926518.0392962, "updated_at": 1783926518.0392966, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_ff2a967b9e89", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00010", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-14"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-14"], "text": "親会社株主に帰属する当期純利に計上した採算事業の撤退に伴う特別損失がなくなったため当期は増益となりました。続いて進捗率についてお知らせいたします。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783926518.0393238, "updated_at": 1783926518.0393238, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_27dddea29aab", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00011", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-15", "stable-16", "stable-17"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-15", "stable-16", "stable-17"], "text": "売上高は通期予算に対して各サービス等も堅調に成長しており、当四半期累計機関におて順調に推移しております。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783926518.0393484, "updated_at": 1783926518.0393484, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_d2522f49e747", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00012", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-18", "stable-19"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-18", "stable-19"], "text": "営業利益は通期予算に対し対応の内定化や不採算事業の定理といた毎期継続している費用削減の施策が確実に低下を収益が概ね予算通りに推移する中、これらの施策が利益の上振れをけん引し四半期累計期間において通期予算を前倒しして達成しました続いて貸借対照表です", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783926518.039374, "updated_at": 1783926518.039374, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_437934e10b85", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00013", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-20", "stable-21"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-20", "stable-21"], "text": "資産の部は販売に伴う販売補助金収入による未収入金の増加、不動産取得保育施設の新設増床による有形工程資産合計は28億7100万円増加しました。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783926518.0394, "updated_at": 1783926518.0394, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_8d3dfd346b93", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00014", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-22", "stable-23", "stable-24"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-22", "stable-23", "stable-24"], "text": "禁忌不動産負債合計は21億3300万円らの結果、自己資本比率はから40。7に低下いたしました。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783926518.0394254, "updated_at": 1783926518.0394254, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
{"canonical_line_id": "cl_01f450d0986c", "stable_line_id": "sl_lineage_00015", "source_commit_ids": ["stable-25"], "represented_source_ids": ["stable-25"], "text": "続いて2026年7月期軽トピックスをお知らせいたし保育サービスにおいては大阪市中国で桜咲く未来東平を予定通り解説しており。桜咲く未来晴海老いでも予定通り増長を行い定員数が増加しまた。", "speaker": 2, "status": "active", "revision_number": 1, "transformation_chain": ["assembler", "boundary_merge", "duplicate_cleanup", "punctuation_cleanup"], "glossary_corrections": [], "financial_number_corrections": [], "created_at": 1783926518.0394506, "updated_at": 1783926518.039451, "duplicate_cleanup_applied": false, "punctuation_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_cleanup_applied": false, "glossary_enabled": false, "raw_mutation": false}
